// Where the leaping-fish spots stand - the five the OSRS wiki gives for Otto's Grotto
// (Fishing spot (barbarian): 2504,3497 2520,3518 2506,3493 2500,3506 2500,3512). Three are spawned
// (maps/m39_54.jm2) and they move among the five like the river spots do.
//
// AND THEY KEEP MOVING, decided 25 November 2026 (DeathPlateau-Bugs#96). A player reported random
// lure and bait spots at this pond; there are none - all three offer Use-rod only and give nothing
// but leaping trout, salmon and sturgeon - and the one thing here that could read as the report is
// this movement, since two of the five tiles are a walk away and one is twenty tiles off. That is
// what the wiki's five locations are for, so pinning them was the alternative and was not taken.
[fishing_movement_ottos_grotto_enum]
inputtype=int
outputtype=coord
val=0,0_39_54_8_41
val=1,0_39_54_24_62
val=2,0_39_54_10_37
val=3,0_39_54_4_50
val=4,0_39_54_4_56
